    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas1.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m telling you, it was an accident! If I had known that was Ami, of course I wouldn’t have used my tongue!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maya, I understand that you are in love with me, but you really need to ask permission before doing that sort of thing.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe she tried and you just didn’t hear her because of where your tongues were?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are neither of you listening to me?! I’m telling you that’s not what happened! I seriously had no idea!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I’m sorry Maya but it’s just really hard to believe you didn’t know when we literally talked about it beforehand.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, this just sounds like an excuse to me. But if you’re worried about getting too carried away, don’t be.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least you got permission. That’s one whole step ahead of Molly and you both kissed the same amount of girls tonight.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas2.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my fucking- no! You’re not listening to me!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas3.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something’s going on! I’m...I’m not myself.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course you are, Maya! It doesn’t matter to either one of us which gender you prefer. You’ll always be Maya to us.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas4.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have roughly thirty seconds left to live.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maya, stop. Making threats isn’t going to change anything. But I don’t want to make a big deal out of this so let’s just chalk it up to a...misunderstanding and agree to not speak about it anymore.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas5.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine! Okay! Whatever! That still doesn’t change the fact that something is seriously wrong with me all of a sudden!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Twenty seconds, Ayane. Don’t even think about making another joke.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean by “something is wrong” though? We still have no clue what that means.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, the timeline for us has been: Maya and Ami kiss, Maya uses tongue, Ami screams, we all leave the room. At what point did something go wrong?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Before that! Do you want to hear my timeline? Halloween. Different Halloween. Makeout session with Ami’s uncle. Makeout session with Ami. Who’s next? Fucking Noriko?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas6.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": AAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHH!!!!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just go along with it. She’s clearly having some sort of episode right now.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not having a fucking episode! The world is clearly breaking and no one seems to be aware of it but me!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s like every five minutes I’m getting sent to a different place in time!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what’s to stop me from making out with literally everyone if it’s just going to be erased in a little while?!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas7.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll go next if it’ll make you feel better. I’m not really into girls, but I won’t lie in saying that I’m feeling kind of left out that your feelings for Ami are so much stronger than your feelings for me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was rhetorical, Ayane! I’m not actually going to do that!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just like you weren’t going to use your tongue on Ami, right?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane, shush. Maya, if something’s actually wrong, shouldn’t you lie down? There’s gotta be some kind of infirmary thingy here, right?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas8.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s exactly how this whole thing started, Ami! You and me were hanging out. Then we were somewhere else.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you said we should lie down in Ayane’s weird hospital room thing. And I agreed. Then I brought up the threesome and you told Molly to get drunk. After that, it’s been like 90%% kissing. I’m going insane!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You sure are. I don’t even know what threesome you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You, me, and Sensei! It was your idea!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas9.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you guys keep leaving me out of stuff?! We can easily make it a foursome instead!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, can you guys maybe not say stuff like that directly in front of Sensei? Thanks.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas10.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! Hi, Sensei. Now the games can really begin.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, what’s going on out here exactly? Because the rest of the girls are wondering when you’re all going to be going back in there for round two.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Where were we just a minute ago?! You remember, right?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...hotel room?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Before that, idiot!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...lobby?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas11.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t pay her any mind, Sensei. Maya’s decided to come up with some weird story about jumping through time because she’s embarrassed about getting too lesbian with Ami.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, Ayane. I think there’s something true about what Maya’s saying. Like, maybe not for us. But what if she actually is part of some weird time-hopping thingy? What do we do to fix it?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas12.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Thank you, Ami! These are the questions we need to be asking! The next jump could happen any second now!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, I’m confused again. Are you saying that the only reason you put your tongue in Ami’s mouth was because you were putting your tongue in my mouth in an alternate timeline beforehand?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Exactly!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you just...happened to teleport to another place in time where you were also making out with someone?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Maya. I had no idea you were this promiscuous...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not promiscuous! It was like...kissing probably triggered it?!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why not try triggering it again?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas13.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good idea. Let’s do it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, with me? I meant that you should kiss one of the girls again. That was hot as hell. And you’re always calling me a creepy stalker anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, well there’s no more pressure on me to save face when you’ve already decided to dump me for your stupid childhood friend. I’m going all out now. And that involves making out with you in front of your niece.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I’d really prefer you didn’t do that.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you at least want to hide behind the excuse of spin the bottle? Because I’m pretty sure I’ve figured out a trick where I can just spin it really softly and have it land on whoever I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your mouth. My mouth. Now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayabacktoxmas14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayabacktoxmas14.webp",
      "alt": "mayabacktoxmas14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mmm!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somebody help! Maya’s going on a kissing rampage and blaming it all on time!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what’s even worse is she’s leaving me out of it!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let...the record show...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...have nothing to do...with this...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is...all her...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, hold on. Does anyone else hear-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
