    },
    {
      "en": "That gash in your hands/the one on your leg\\nIt matches my eyes/that same shade of red",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So why do you run?/Why do you hide?\\nIf the memories fade/why not keep them inside?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve always been here/You’re never alone\\nOur love is a house/We can make it a home",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A room for your pain/a room for your doubt\\nA room for your sister/A place to black out",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If death is a lake/we’ll dive in as one\\nOur feet touch the sand/Our hearts touch the sun",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Remember the smell/Remember the light\\nRemember to smile/Remember I might",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But only if you can/forget everything\\nIf you promise me that/I’ll repair these old wings",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And we’ll fly off together to a place no one can reach us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
